<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="OBA" style="id">Obadiah</book>
  <para style="h">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Obadiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Obadiah nih a chimmi bia: Mah hihi Bawipa Pathian nih Edom kong ah a chimmi bia a si. Bawipa nih miphun hna sinah lamkal a thlah i, “I hlau tuah u; Edom doh awkah i hlau tuah u sih,” tiah lamkaltu nih cun a ti tikah, Hi bia hi Bawipa sin khan ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih Edom cu a thawh i, “Nangmah cu kaan hmetter lai, mi kip nih an in serhsat lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lungpuamnak nih a pingah an hruai cang; Nang cu lung in sermi ralhruang chungah khan na um i Na inn cu tlang sangpi cungah khin a si caah, ‘Aho nih dah an ka ṭhumh khawh lai?’ tiah naa zum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na umnak cu muvanlai bu tlukin sang in, na bu cu arfi hna lakah khin si ko hmanh seh law, Khika khin kaan ṭhumh ṭhiamṭhiam ko lai,” tiah Bawipa nih a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mifir nih si hna seh, philhmangmi nih si hna seh, zan ah an in fuh tikah, Annih nih cun an duhmi lawng kha an lak ko; Cun mitsur thei cu a lomi nih an lawh tikah tlawmpal cu an nganh ta zungzal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Esau, na ral nih na rothil cu an hlai dih i an lak dih cang, Na thuhmi na chawhlawn vialte cu an chuah dih cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah sin i a ṭangmi hna nih khan an in hlen i Na ram chungin an in dawi cang. Nangmah he i rem tein a rak ummi hna nih khan an in tei cang. Na sin i ti ding rawl ei in a ummi na hawile nih khan rap an in chiahhnawh cang i, “A fimnak vialte kha tah khuazei ah dah a si kun?” an in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Edom cu dan ka tat ni hrimhrim ah an mifim hna cu ka thah hna lai i Esau Tlang in fimnak cu ka hloh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Teman ralkap hna cu an thin a phang lai i, Esau Tlang i a ummi ralkap vialte kha thah an si lai,” tiah Bawipa nih a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nangmah nih na unau a simi Jakob tefa hna kha na ramh hna i na thah hna caah Nangmah cu zungzal in hrawh le ningzahnak pek na si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ral nih an kutka kha an bauh hna i an chawva vialte kha an lak i Jerusalem khua kha camcawhfung khiah in an i cheuh ni ah khan, Nang cu na dir sawhsawh ko i annih he khan lungkhat in na um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na unau hna cu an van a chiat caah khan diriam in na um awk a si lo, Judah mi kha an rawk ni ah naa lawmh awk zong a si lo; Harnak an ton ni ah na nihsawh awk hna zong a si fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mi hna cu an rawhral ni ah khan an chawva va lak awk le An temhinnak kha nang i rak i lawmhpi awkah an khua chungah na rak luh awk a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zam aa timmi hna thah awkah khan lamtonnak hmun ah khan na rak dir awk a si lo i, An har ni ah khan an ral hna kut chungah khan na rak chanh hna awk a si lo,” tiah Bawipa nih a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Miphun vialte kha Bawipa nih bia a ceih hna lai ni a nai cang. Edom, na tuahmi kha na cungah a tlung ve lai; Na tuahmi kha na lu cungah a kir ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka mi hna nih ka tlang thiang cungah dantatnak hrai a khaami kha an din cang. Cun hi ram pawngkam i a ummi miphun hna nih cu nakin a ṭhalo chinchinmi dantatnak kha an din lai; An din lai i an dolh lai i an lo lai.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Sihmanhsehlaw Zion Tlang ah cun a luatmi cu an um lai i cu hmun cu hmun thiang a si lai. Jakob nih a ram a rak chuttu hna kha a chuh ṭhan ve hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khi tikah Jakob innchungkhar hna cu mei an si lai i Josef chungkhar hna cu meizik an si lai; Esau chungkhar tu cu favai an si lai; Esau mi hna cu mei nih facang hmui a kangh bangin an kangh hna lai i Esau tefa cu a nungmi an um lai lo,” tiah Bawipa nih a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Negeb i a ummi Israel mi nih Esau Tlang kha an co lai; Judah ram thlanglei i a ummi hna nih Filistin mi hna ram kha an lak lai; Israel mi hna nih Efraim le Samaria ram kha an co lai i Benjamin mi nih Gilead ram kha an co lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mi saltangmi hna nih khan Kanaan ram kha Zarefath tiang an co lai, Jerusalem mi saltangmi hna nih khan Negeb ram i khua kha an co hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mi hna cu Zion Tlang ah an kai lai i Esau Tlang cu an uk lai. Cun Bawipa cu Siangpahrang a si lai.”
  </para>
</usx>
